    22 3D40			 icl 'ribbon.inc'
Source: ribbon.inc
     1 				; ribbon.inc - shared WOW-series shell: menu bar, command bar, Tab completion.
     2 				; Included by an app (ACWriter, later ACSpread/ACDBase). The app provides:
     3 				;   NMENU        number of menus; tabl/tabh name strings, tooll/toolh hint strings per menu
     4 				;   items        draws the item line of menu cmode (shown while mn = 2)
     5 				;   mn           menu state: 0 off, 1 waiting for a menu letter, 2 waiting for an item letter
     6 				;   cmdtab       command names, each 0-terminated, table ends with an extra 0
     7 				;   cmdexec      runs command number A (position in cmdtab); sets fl as the editor expects
     8 				;   appmsg       draws a custom message with putstr/putnum when cmsg = 3
     9 				;   helpmsg      idle text of the command bar
    10 				;   rowsetup, drawtext, putc, putstr, ROWS, BUF, CMDB, and the zero-page variables
    11 				;   kk (key), cmode, cmdon, clen, bd, cmsg, tmp, src, tp, rr, bi
    12
